<section id="about" class="bg-cream py-[80px] px-6 md:px-16">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
    <div>
      <span class="font-mono text-primary text-xs uppercase tracking-[1px] block mb-4">Why work with us</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-[44px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.4px] text-ink mb-6">
        Specialized service, not generic contracting.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Al Sahra Tents & Sheds Fix was established in Sharjah, UAE, with one goal: to provide the most reliable sales and service support for tents and shades in the country. Our strength is in the comprehensive, individually tailored service we offer every customer — a standard we call "Specialized Service."
      </p>
      <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-base leading-relaxed">
        Every project is an individually tailored, one-stop package — from first design conversation through manufacturing, delivery, and installation, without compromising on quality or realistic pricing.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-8">
      <div class="bg-canvas p-8 rounded-[16px] border border-hairline shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-[18px] text-ink mb-2">Global Fabric Partnerships</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-sm leading-relaxed">
          We source tensile fabric from the industry's most innovative manufacturers in Germany, France, and Australia, ensuring every structure meets international standards.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-8 rounded-[16px] border border-hairline shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-body font-semibold text-[18px] text-ink mb-2">Design to Installation, In-House</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-ink-soft text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Every product is individually designed and fabricated to match your project's exact requirements, with a direct line between our design team and installation crew.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
